    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n72569" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνο-φόρος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>holding wine,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κύλιξ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Critias
					6.2
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i> ; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δέρμα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>PLond.</u>
					2.402v
				</span></i>
			.<i><span class="en">
				22
			</span></i>
			<span class="entity">(ii B. C.)</span>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεύη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hdn.
					8.4.4
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			Subst.
			<b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οἰνο-φόρον</span></b>  (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σκεῦος</span> or <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀγγεῖον</span>), τό,
				<i>wine-jar,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				6.14
			</span></i> : <i>oenophorus</i> Probusin <i><span class="en">
				<u>Gramm.Lat.</u>
				4.211
			</span></i> K. (gender indeterminate in Hor.<i><span class="en">
				<u>Sat.</u>
				1.6.109
			</span></i>, etc.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>wine-producing,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">βότρυς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Archestr.
					<u>Fr.</u>
					36.2
				</span></i>
			.</div>
